                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20441</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The ip2nets/routes deprecation was only added in commit 2.16.61-44-g6b46e3fd8a, so it hasn't been in any LTS release yet and nobody has really had a chance to see it. We should make ip2nets/routes deprecated, but available, in the next LTS. This ticket tracks bumping the ifdef version&lt;/p&gt;</description>
